6. WHAT WAS REPLACED, AND WHY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Two asset groups inside the vendored environment did not come with terms that
  allowed redistribution on their own strength. The author's permission covers
  his own work, not other people's, so neither was published on that basis.

  Regenerated from permissively licensed data:
    ir_base/models/artag/  - 18 marker images, model.sdf, model.config and the
                             16 OGRE material scripts.

  Verified as permissively licensed and retained unchanged:
    ir_base/models/cafe_table/ - CC-BY-3.0, attributed in section 2b.

  The previous versions of the regenerated files remain in this repository's git
  history, where they are still credited to their original author. Anyone
  needing the exact prior bytes can read them from the commit that precedes this
  one; nothing was deleted from history.

  Compatibility: the replacement preserves every file path, file name, material
  name, model name and marker id, and the marker patterns are bit-identical at
  module level. The simulation configuration therefore needed no change.
